mw2coop patch for maps/roadkill_code.gsc (Team Player, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_roadkill.gsc. Outside a co-op campaign
session every change does what the original did.

1. The glowing seat answers either player (player 1 first on a tie), and says who.
@@@ replace
		if ( Distance( self.origin, level.player.origin ) < 80 )
			self notify( "trigger" );
@@@ with
		foreach ( player in level.players )
			if ( Distance( self.origin, player.origin ) < 80 )
				self notify( "trigger", player );
@@@ end

2. Whoever boards first is the gunner (maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::boarding_gunner; player 1
   outside co-op).
@@@ replace
	chair waittill( "trigger" );
	level.player DisableWeapons();
@@@ with
	chair waittill( "trigger", user );
	gunner = maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::boarding_gunner( user );
	gunner DisableWeapons();
@@@ end

3. In co-op the convoy leaves ("player_gets_in") once the second player has boarded too.
@@@ replace
	flag_set( "player_gets_in" );
@@@ with
	self maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::gunner_boarded();
@@@ end

4. The get-in animation is the gunner's.
@@@ replace
	level.player SetStance( "stand" );
	level.player AllowCrouch( false );
	level.player AllowProne( false );

	level.player PlayerLinkToBlend( player_rig, "tag_player", 0.4, 0.2, 0.2 );
@@@ with
	gunner SetStance( "stand" );
	gunner AllowCrouch( false );
	gunner AllowProne( false );

	gunner PlayerLinkToBlend( player_rig, "tag_player", 0.4, 0.2, 0.2 );
@@@ end

5. ... and so are the weapons afterwards.
@@@ replace
	level.player EnableWeapons();
	player_gets_on_turret();
@@@ with
	gunner EnableWeapons();
	player_gets_on_turret();
@@@ end

6. The turret goes to the gunner (maps\_mw2coop::vehicle_gunner(): player 1 outside co-op).
@@@ replace
player_gets_on_turret()
{
	thread warn_if_player_shoots_prematurely();

	level.player AllowCrouch( true );
	level.player AllowProne( true );

	//level.player PlayerLinkTo( self, "tag_player", 0 );
	level.player PlayerLinkToDelta( self, "tag_player", 0.35, 360, 360, 45, 30, true );
	turret = self.mgturret[ 0 ];
	turret SetModel( "weapon_suburban_minigun_viewmodel" );
	turret MakeUsable();
	turret SetMode( "manual" );
	turret UseBy( level.player );
	turret MakeUnusable();
	//turret Hide();
	level.player_turret = turret;
	level.player SetPlayerAngles( ( 0, level.player_humvee.angles[ 1 ], 0 ) );

//	thread player_viewhands_minigun( level.suburbans[ 2 ].mgturret[ 0 ] );
	level.player DisableTurretDismount();

	thread maps\_minigun_viewmodel::player_viewhands_minigun( turret );
}
@@@ with
player_gets_on_turret()
{
	gunner = maps\_mw2coop::vehicle_gunner();
	thread warn_if_player_shoots_prematurely();

	gunner AllowCrouch( true );
	gunner AllowProne( true );

	//gunner PlayerLinkTo( self, "tag_player", 0 );
	gunner PlayerLinkToDelta( self, "tag_player", 0.35, 360, 360, 45, 30, true );
	turret = self.mgturret[ 0 ];
	turret SetModel( "weapon_suburban_minigun_viewmodel" );
	turret MakeUsable();
	turret SetMode( "manual" );
	turret UseBy( gunner );
	turret MakeUnusable();
	//turret Hide();
	level.player_turret = turret;
	gunner SetPlayerAngles( ( 0, level.player_humvee.angles[ 1 ], 0 ) );

//	thread player_viewhands_minigun( level.suburbans[ 2 ].mgturret[ 0 ] );
	gunner DisableTurretDismount();

	thread maps\_minigun_viewmodel::player_viewhands_minigun( turret );
}
@@@ end

7. Start points that begin on the turret: the second player rides on a rear seat.
@@@ replace
	self player_gets_on_turret();
@@@ with
	self player_gets_on_turret();
	self thread maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::partner_rides_now();
@@@ end

8. Shepherd's "get on the line" scene: player 2 shares player 1's view rig (as COD-MOD did), so
   both see the scene and start the fight in the same place.
@@@ replace
	level.player PlayerLinkToDelta( player_rig, "tag_player", 1, arc, arc, arc, arc, 1 );
@@@ with
	level.player PlayerLinkToDelta( player_rig, "tag_player", 1, arc, arc, arc, arc, 1 );
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		level.player2 maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::share_scene_rig( player_rig, arc );
@@@ end

9. ... and leaves it next to player 1.
@@@ replace
	struct waittill ( scene );
	level.player unlink();
@@@ with
	struct waittill ( scene );
	level.player unlink();
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		level.player2 maps\_mw2coop_roadkill::leave_scene_rig();
@@@ end
